  "description": "This is not fake news: Fat bikes have evolved from 1-season freaks that were built for riders who couldn’t make it through snowy winters without a pedal. So we’ve changed with the times and updated our flagship Mayor to be a legit all-season bike. The best value in the fat bike category is now an excellent candidate for year-round trail campaigns.To make good on this claim, these small but significant changes were made to V.6 Mayor:\n\nSame Slacker head angle – 66.5 degrees Same Steeper seat tube angle – 75 degrees Sliding drop-outs and new V6 chainstay lengths of 440mm-455mm. Internal dropper-post cable routing\n\nThe qualities that made your old Mayor great are still true:\n\nCustom hydro-formed 6061 tubing and RSD carbon fork Massive rear stays to guarantee lateral rigidity 197mm rear thru-axle and 150mm front spacing Proven build with RaceFace cockpit and Turbine cranks with direct-mount 28t ring Sun Ringlé Mulefüt V2 80mm wheels shod with Maxxis Minion 4.8” rubber, allowing up to 100mm rims and 5.05” tires",
